AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill provides that unless expressly prohibited by state or federal law, local governmental
entities may not prohibit or impede any state or federal law enforcement agency from complying
with federal immigration laws, and provides for remedies for violations. This bill further authorizes
county corrections facilities to hold Immigration and Customs Enforcement detentions, for the
resolution of state charges or for a maximum of an additional 48 hours, excluding Saturdays,
Sundays, and holidays, if the county and the Immigration and Customs Enforcement Agency have
executedanagreementinaccordancewithRSA30-B:16.

